<details class="small mt-1 google-review-link-steps">
  <summary>How do I find my Google review link?</summary>
  <ol class="mb-1 mt-1 ps-3">
    <li>On a computer, sign in to the Google account that manages your business, then search Google for your business name. The panel for managing your business shows at the top of the results.</li>
    <li>Click <strong>Ask for reviews</strong>. On some screens it is <strong>Read reviews</strong>, then <strong>Get more reviews</strong>.</li>
    <li>Copy the link it shows (it looks like https://g.page/r/.../review) and paste it here.</li>
  </ol>
  <div>In the Google Maps app the same link is under <strong>Customers</strong> &gt; <strong>Reviews</strong> &gt; <strong>Get more reviews</strong>. No link yet? Your business needs a Google Business Profile first: claim it at business.google.com.</div>
</details>
